    <detaileddescription>
<para>Like <computeroutput>test_body</computeroutput>, with a <computeroutput>suite&amp;</computeroutput> reference as the first argument. The body is stored in a <computeroutput>std::function</computeroutput>, so the callable object and the arguments must also be copyable; this is checked for the generic callables too.</para>
